{"seq":24,"id":"agent.run","props":{"input":"create characters.  the protagonist is male.  there are 4 female love interests and 3 male friends.  also a school headmistress and two professors.","scene":"opening"},"invocation":"agent.run(input='create characters.  the protagonist is male.  there are 4 female love interests and 3 male friends.  also a school headmistress and two professors.' scene='opening')","source":"ui","mutating":true,"gitHead":"4c459cc01d18b1f0e3fdea7b498477015402f84b","gitDirty":true,"startedAt":"2026-08-18T05:52:48.167Z","finishedAt":"2026-08-18T05:54:35.419Z","status":"ok","message":"Done — 11 characters scaffolded, validated clean, and committed as `8f0f60df`:\n\n- **Protagonist:** caedon_vale\n- **Love interests:** seraphine_halcyon, ember_kellan, wren_ashfield, isolde_vorn\n- **Friends:** tobias_renn, gideon_marsh, pip_calloway\n- **Faculty:** headmistress_auria_coyle, professor_silas_thorn, professor_mirabel_quist\n\nOne caveat, reported honestly: I created these from names only, so each sheet is a **placeholder template** — the front-matter fields (traits, palette, default_outfit, art_notes) and the canonical prose body are still stubs, not filled-in descriptions. Their names hint at world ties (Halcyon, Vorn, ember/ash, Loomwright), but nothing is written yet.\n\nWant me to flesh them out now? I'd suggest going character-by-character (or in small batches) so we can set each one's Order affiliation, current (Sela/Vash), nation, traits, palette, and description deliberately. Tell me where to start — or I can draft all 11 and you review.","commits":[{"repo":"C:\\dev\\visualnovel\\examples\\test4","sha":"561d86f9d32aa4933b8cc1d76dd002917d918516"}]}
